{"schemaVersion":1,"courseNo":42,"lessonId":"sky/island-database/42-sql-select","authored":true,"slides":[{"layout":"title","emoji":"🔍","title":"SQL SELECT 文","subtitle":"表からデータを\n取り出す書き方。","blocks":[]},{"emoji":"🛒","title":"まず、たとえ話から","blocks":[{"t":"analogy","icon":"🛒","real":"棚から商品を**取り出す**作業。\n条件や並べ替えもできる。","tech":"**SELECT** =\nテーブルからデータを取得する文"}]},{"emoji":"⌨️","title":"基本の形","blocks":[{"t":"code","lang":"sql","text":"SELECT 名前, 点数\nFROM 成績;"}]},{"emoji":"📤","title":"実行結果","blocks":[{"t":"table","head":["名前","点数"],"rows":[["山田","80"],["佐藤","90"]],"caption":"SELECT の結果は ==表== で返る"}]},{"emoji":"🎯","title":"WHERE","blocks":[{"t":"big","text":"**WHERE** = 行を絞り込む","sub":"条件に合う行だけ残す"}]},{"emoji":"🔤","title":"LIKE の書き方","blocks":[{"t":"code","lang":"sql","text":"WHERE 名前 LIKE \u0027田%\u0027;"},{"t":"p","text":"`%` は任意の文字列。\n**「田」で始まる**。"}]},{"emoji":"↕️","title":"ORDER BY","blocks":[{"t":"big","text":"**ORDER BY** = 並べ替え","sub":"指定した列の順に並べる"}]},{"emoji":"✨","title":"DISTINCT","blocks":[{"t":"big","text":"**DISTINCT** = 重複行を除外","sub":"同じ行は 1 回だけ"}]},{"emoji":"✅","title":"確認①","blocks":[{"t":"check","q":"表からデータを取る SQL は？","choices":["INSERT","UPDATE","SELECT","DELETE"],"answer":2,"explain":"取得は **SELECT**。","hint":"取り出す文。"}]},{"emoji":"✅","title":"確認②","blocks":[{"t":"check","q":"「木」で終わる名前のパターンは？","choices":["LIKE \u0027木%\u0027","LIKE \u0027%木\u0027","LIKE \u0027木\u0027","IN (\u0027木\u0027)"],"answer":1,"explain":"末尾一致は ==\u0027%木\u0027==。"}]},{"emoji":"📝","title":"試験の型","blocks":[{"t":"callout","kind":"exam","text":"始まり `文字%` / 終わり `%文字`\n重複除去は **DISTINCT**"}]},{"emoji":"🏁","title":"まとめ","blocks":[{"t":"bullets","items":["**SELECT** … 取り出す","**WHERE / LIKE** … 条件","**ORDER BY / DISTINCT** … 並びと重複"]}]}]}